HR Application Modules

1. HR Master

Master HR menyimpan struktur dan konfigurasi utama organisasi serta ketenagakerjaan.

* Organization Unit
* Division
* Department
* Section
* Team
* Job Position
* Job Title
* Job Level
* Grade
* Employment Type
* Employment Status
* Employee Group
* Shift
* Work Schedule
* Calendar
* Holiday
* Cost Center
* Work Location
* Site

2. Employee Management

Modul utama untuk menyimpan seluruh data karyawan.

* Employee
* Employee Profile
* Employment Information
* Organization Assignment
* Address
* Education History
* Work Experience
* Family
* Emergency Contact
* Bank Account
* Document
* Skill
* Language
* Certificate
* License
* Employee Contract
* Salary History
* Supervisor Assignment
* Employee Transfer
* Employee Promotion
* Employee Separation

3. Attendance & Time Management

Mengelola waktu kerja dan kehadiran karyawan.

* Attendance
* Clock In / Clock Out
* Shift Assignment
* Work Schedule
* Roster
* Leave Request
* Leave Balance
* Overtime Request
* Business Trip
* Timesheet
* Attendance Correction
* Holiday Calendar

4. Payroll

Mengelola komponen penghasilan, potongan, proses payroll, dan payslip.

* Salary Component
* Allowance
* Deduction
* Payroll Group
* Payroll Period
* Payroll Input
* Payroll Process
* Payroll Result
* Payslip
* Tax Configuration
* BPJS Configuration
* Employee Payroll Profile
* Bank Transfer
* Payroll Journal
* Payroll Approval

5. Recruitment

Mengelola proses penerimaan karyawan baru.

* Manpower Request
* Job Vacancy
* Candidate
* Candidate Application
* Screening
* Interview
* Assessment
* Job Offer
* Hiring Approval
* Onboarding

6. Performance Management

Mengelola target, KPI, penilaian, dan evaluasi kinerja.

* KPI
* KPI Assignment
* KPI Target
* Performance Cycle
* Performance Template
* Performance Review
* Performance Rating
* Performance Score
* Goal Setting
* Appraisal
* Development Plan
* 360 Feedback

7. Competency Management

Mengelola kompetensi yang dibutuhkan dan dimiliki karyawan.

* Competency Category
* Competency
* Competency Level
* Position Competency
* Employee Competency
* Competency Assessment
* Competency Gap
* Development Recommendation

8. Learning & Development

Mengelola pelatihan dan pengembangan karyawan.

* Training Category
* Training Program
* Training Schedule
* Training Participant
* Training Attendance
* Training Result
* Certificate
* Learning History
* Development Plan

9. Employee Separation

Mengelola proses akhir hubungan kerja.

* Resignation
* Termination
* Retirement
* Exit Interview
* Exit Clearance
* Asset Return
* Final Payroll
* Employee Offboarding

